Significant changes in: Relationships. Well-being of self or family member. Body image. Job, school, university, house, locality. Financial situation. World environment.
Significant losses: Death of a loved one. Loss of a valued relationship. Loss of self esteem or personal expectations. Loss of employment.
Perceived abuse: Physical. Emotional/Psychological. Sexual. Social. Neglect.
