Sept 17, 2018 (LBO) – Outlining plans to support Sri Lanka in achieving the Sustainable Development Goals, Unilever Sri Lanka and United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) handed over a policy action paper for the promotion of public private partnerships for sustainable development to the secretary to President.
