The San Jose-Dublin Sister City Program plans to honor longtime South Bay resident and KRON-TV news anchor Catherine Heenan as its Spirit of Ireland Award recipient on opening night of ��Yulan,�� and Quigley said that the goal is to have some of the proceeds from ��The Terracotta Prince�� help the program establish an arts scholarship.
